   <note>
    <pitch>
     <step>F</step>
     <octave>4</octave>
    </pitch>
    <duration>384</duration>
    <voice>1</voice>
    <type>whole</type>
    <stem>up</stem>
    <staff>1</staff>
    <lyric number="1">
     <syllabic>single</syllabic>
     <text xml:lang="ko">1.하늘에 계신 우리</text>
    </lyric>
    <lyric number="3">
     <syllabic>single</syllabic>
     <text xml:lang="ko">2.나라이 임하옵시며 뜻이</text>
    </lyric>
    <lyric number="5">
     <syllabic>single</syllabic>
     <text xml:lang="ko">3.오늘날 우리에게</text>
    </lyric>
    <lyric number="7">
     <syllabic>single</syllabic>
     <text xml:lang="ko">4.우리가 우리에게 죄 지은 자를 사하여</text>
    </lyric>
    <lyric number="9">
     <syllabic>single</syllabic>
     <text xml:lang="ko">5.우리를 시험에 들게 하지</text>
    </lyric>
    <lyric number="11">
     <syllabic>single</syllabic>
     <text xml:lang="ko">6.대개 나라와 권세와</text>
    </lyric>
   </note>
